bcom:source-595623379389a4997c357feabba3d792d8cfc4366e35546f14aed3ce71847012 bco:departureNote "BACM's OrgUnit, the performer through which capabilities are implemented, includes individuals. The BCO admits only an Organization as the bearer of a Business Capability (CD1); an individual's ability is CCO Skill or Agent Capability and is out of scope."@en .
