bcom:source-78bd85c7357b52df42a90588ba3c9c1045de53fa349fa1c2208a298049c6870d bco:relation "adapted-from" .

bcom:source-86ebec3b3a2fd6ef8f8882da534522db5a85e3ae1bcdffad76e3e6a5aa1a254c bco:citesClaim "1"^^xsd:integer .
bcom:source-86ebec3b3a2fd6ef8f8882da534522db5a85e3ae1bcdffad76e3e6a5aa1a254c bco:citesSource bcos:SRC-GOV-04 .
bcom:source-86ebec3b3a2fd6ef8f8882da534522db5a85e3ae1bcdffad76e3e6a5aa1a254c bco:departureNote "NAF defines a capability by what one or more resources can be expected to deliver, and its resources cover systems and equipment as well as organizations. The BCO narrows the bearer to an Organization (CD1); an organization-borne capability is a special case NAF permits, so the BCO narrows NAF rather than contradicting it."@en .
