bcom:source-9e0ae7b454e724daac1ace5bb02dd6384fb5f28e00f986bd1102b13207d5cd9e bco:citesClaim "1"^^xsd:integer .
bcom:source-9e0ae7b454e724daac1ace5bb02dd6384fb5f28e00f986bd1102b13207d5cd9e bco:citesSource bcos:SRC-FO-12 .
bcom:source-9e0ae7b454e724daac1ace5bb02dd6384fb5f28e00f986bd1102b13207d5cd9e bco:departureNote "In CDD the Capability doubles as the requirement for an ability to meet a goal. The BCO keeps the two apart: the requirement is a Capability Target, an Objective that prescribes that an organization come to bear a capability of a given type, and the capability itself is a disposition the target does not imply exists."@en .
bcom:source-9e0ae7b454e724daac1ace5bb02dd6384fb5f28e00f986bd1102b13207d5cd9e bco:locator "CaaS project, Definitions of concepts web page (Capability is required by a Goal and serves to formulate requirements)" .
bcom:source-9e0ae7b454e724daac1ace5bb02dd6384fb5f28e00f986bd1102b13207d5cd9e bco:relation "departs-from" .

