bcom:source-f2d6bd28e9a2bfdefa6d93c160beb4c73355133214f30f008c5572a16465e319 bco:departureNote "ISO 19440 assigns a provided Capability to a Resource, which since the 2020 edition includes active Resources such as people, machines and IT. The BCO admits only an Organization as bearer (CD1)."@en .
